{"parentUuid":"dcaff927-529c-4a97-ab5d-6078c90d366f","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"a8f1a005-6197-4ac8-b6c3-3f7619cec3c7","agentId":"a4640130e3de3efa2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019KmKCuFxLcBRpwoAVoWy6o","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\"parentUuid\":null,\"isSidechain\":true,\"promptId\":\"cc582654-a0c2-4361-82b9-583c64e2cd72\",\"agentId\":\"a8eb034b3b1213a9c\",\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":\"P0 #6 改造 4 数学条件核实任务。\\n\\n**背景**：R12 patch blueprint agent (`a91a3c90b172df1ce`) 给了改造 4 (membership reify) 蓝图：\\n```python\\n# before (line 2347-2348 in src/models/exact_coordinate_master.py, 共约 18 处)\\nself.model.Add(slot.signature == int(bucket_int)).OnlyEnforceIf(bucket_lit)\\nself.model.Add(slot.signature != int(bucket_int)).OnlyEnforceIf(bucket_lit.Not())\\n# after\\nself.model.Add(slot.signature == sum(int(bucket_id_to_int[b])*bucket_lits[i] for i,b in ...))\\n```\\n\\nagent 标\\\"中等风险\\\"——改造 4 替换的是**双向 full-reify**（signature == bucket_int ⟺ bucket_lit），改成线性 channeling 需要数学条件。\\n\\n**任务（≤700 字）**：核实改造 4 在我们 codebase 是否真的语义等价且无副作用。\\n\\n1. **读 `D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\\\\src\\\\models\\\\exact_coordinate_master.py` 围绕 line 2342-2400 + line 2415-2445 + line 2625-2700**（这是 18 处 membership reify 的两个主要 cluster）\\n2. **数学条件验证**：\\n   - signature 变量域是不是限定在 bucket_int 集合？（grep `slot.signature` 的 `NewIntVar` 定义看 lower/upper bound）\\n   - 是否有其他约束让 signature 只能取 bucket_int 之一？\\n   - 如果 signature 自然限定 → 改造 4 安全（添加 `signature = sum(bucket_int*lit)` 自动让 sum=1，bucket_lits 自然 mutually exclusive）\\n   - 如果 signature 域更宽 → 改造 4 **改变可行解集合**（强制 signature 进入 bucket_int 集合），是 SEMANTIC CHANGE\\n3. **PROJECT_LOCK Forbidden Changes 核对**：\\n   - 改造 4 是否触及 ghost rectangle 几何 enforcement？(signature 跟 ghost rectangle 啥关系？)\\n   - 是否 reduce 可行解集合（如果是，违反\\\"不动 schemas\\\"精神）\\n4. **CP-SAT 实际收益 vs 风险**：\\n   - 改造 4 会 remove 18 个双向 reify → 替换为 1 个线性 + 1 个 ExactlyOne（如果还需加）\\n   - 净 effect：约束数 -36+2 = -34；变量数不变\\n   - 但如果数学条件不成立，可行解集合改变 → certified_exact 可能变 incorrect\\n\\n输出末尾：\\\"改造 4 verdict = SAFE / SEMANTIC_CHANGE / NEEDS_ADDED_CONSTRAINT\\\" + 具体推荐（要么 patch 蓝图，要么放弃）\"},\"uuid\":\"56a58859-f2bf-433e-a010-145b11a4a3e3\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-08T00:29:07.531Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n2\t{\"parentUuid\":\"56a58859-f2bf-433e-a010-145b11a4a3e3\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a8eb034b3b1213a9c\",\"attachment\":{\"type\":\"deferred_tools_delta\",\"addedNames\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"addedLines\":[\"EnterWorktree\",\"ExitWorktree\",\"Monitor\",\"NotebookEdit\",\"TaskStop\",\"WebFetch\",\"WebSearch\"],\"removedNames\":[],\"readdedNames\":[]},\"type\":\"attachment\",\"uuid\":\"a596f709-a422-4e84-bd5a-4c36e0e892db\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-05-08T00:29:07.534Z\",\"userType\":\"external\",\"entrypoint\":\"cli\",\"cwd\":\"D:\\\\claude pj\\\\zmd\",\"sessionId\":\"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9\",\"version\":\"2.1.128\",\"gitBranch\":\"master\",\"slug\":\"squishy-zooming-sphinx\"}\n3\t{\"parentUuid\":\"a596f709-a422-4e84-bd5a-4c36e0e892db\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"agentId\":\"a8eb034b3b1213a9c\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-4-7\",\"id\":\"msg_01Hg9YxdoLqVXqAMePneT5Xk\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I'll analyze the membership reify pattern in `exact_coordinate_master.py` to verify if 改造 4 is mathematically safe.\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":6,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":19651,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":19651,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":0},\"output_tokens\":7,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_avai